      "traits": [
        "aura",
        "olfactory",
        "poison"
      ],
      "description": "<p>5 feet. The scented candle homunculus's fragrance of lavender is overwhelmingly intense. Any creature other than the homunculus's master who enters the aura must attempt a DC 15 Fortitude Saving Throw save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is temporarily immune to the homunculus's aura for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is Sickened 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is Stupefied 1 for 1 round and sickened 1.</p>",
